#
#  What this box still cannot do is name a DESTINATION for a deposit: the
#  receive subaddress is minted inside the job on the vault, and the Pi never
#  supplies one. That was always the load-bearing half.
#
#  What reaches the wire after all the conversation is one key holding one
#  bounded int: ("receive_and_quote", {"amount_sat": N}), in satoshis, so no
#  float and no locale ever touch it.
#
#  IN MEMORY, NEVER ON THE CARD. The --state file holds Limits and lives on the
#  same SD card as the sealed keyfile; a half-finished /depo does not belong
